# Design specs and implementation plans. Working notes for a single change, kept
# local: they age out the moment the change lands, and tracking them put ~10k
# added lines into PR diffs that nobody reviewed. The design rationale that
# outlives a PR belongs in the code, an ADR, or the issue.
docs/superpowers/
extension/docs/superpowers/
extension/docs/plans/
